      <p><strong>2023–present</strong> · Trustee, New Zealand Data Trust — supporting Dame Diane Robertson</p>
      <p><strong>2021–present</strong> · Independent advice on Social Investment — to the Minister, the board, and the Social Investment Agency</p>
      <p><strong>2013–present</strong> · Director, Noos Limited — independent advisory practice</p>
      <p><strong>2020–23</strong> · Set up the advanced-analytics team, K&#257;inga Ora</p>
