      <p><strong>2016–18</strong> · Founder, New Zealand Data Commons</p>
      <p><strong>2015–22</strong> · Board Member, Te P&#363;naha Matatini — the &ldquo;Big Data&rdquo; Centre of Research Excellence</p>
      <p><strong>2015–18</strong> · International advisor to Chile and Australia on Social Investment</p>
      <p><strong>2015–18</strong> · Inland Revenue — supported the Deputy Chief Executive to introduce advanced analytics</p>
      <p><strong>2013</strong> · Appointed member, NZ Data Futures Forum — recommendations adopted nationally; recognised by the UN's Global Pulse</p>
      <p><strong>2012</strong> · Special Advisor, New Zealand Treasury — added comprehensive social-sector data into the Integrated Data Infrastructure (IDI)</p>
